# Love and Ice not yet accepted, Carmelo's Song Sheet held (a GM's key item): Mirror Pond's trigger is in the accepted
# section only, so nothing plays. The pond shows only outside snow and blizzards: the char starts in Beaucedine Glacier
# on weather day 1520 (blizzards only), waits for day 1521, and under the pinned weather seed the second change there
# is auroras (this depends on the seed).
char zone=BeaucedineGlacier pos=-94.7,1.518,-392.7 lvl=75
keyitem CarmelosSongSheet
login
wait vana=12                   # day 8001 (weather day 1521)
tick 1800000                   # a weather change: snow
tick 1800000                   # auroras: the pond shown
trigger Mirror_Pond_1          # available: no handler, nothing
finish-if-event
